{"updated":"2026-11-14T15:31:43.786Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"Dft-ss9EwuY","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dft-ss9EwuY","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Gemini最近出了多款新模型\n一分鐘帶你了解\n#AI","timestamp":"2026-11-14T10:22:49.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DftIxBkgKxL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DftIxBkgKxL","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"用Fable做的影片","timestamp":"2026-11-14T02:30:44.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfq_yD8k8SC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfq_yD8k8SC","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"我把新北歡樂耶誕城搬進瀏覽器了，還能揪朋友一起逛。🎄\n輸入暱稱、分享房間連結，大家就會出現在同一座 3D 耶誕城。\n每間房間最多 40 人，也能用私人房間代碼約朋友集合。\n一起逛市民廣場、板橋車站、萬坪公園等燈區 \n邊走邊聊天，揮手、比愛心、跳舞、擺 Pose\n按下拍照，全房間收到 3 秒倒數提示\n合照能套耶誕框或拍立得，下載留念\n走到捷運站搭車，前往淡水、新莊等響應燈區","timestamp":"2026-11-13T06:33:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfq_x9pkye5","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfq_x9pkye5","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"線上一起逛\nntpc-christmasland-3d.malilion.workers.d…","timestamp":"2026-11-13T06:33:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfq79LyE1LH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfq79LyE1LH","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"13 張 AI 圖，約 1.3 美元的生圖成本。 \n作者把它們做成了一套 3D 萬聖節村莊素材。\n 📦 更有趣的是，每個模型還能從一張平面紙，慢慢「折」成立體。\n這個開源 Claude Code Skill 叫 Origami-3Dfolder-ai，走的是一套數位摺紙流程： 幾何形狀 → UV 展開圖 → AI 上色 → Blender 折回 3D\n－製作木箱、桌子、攤位、樹木等低多邊形道具 －輸出帶貼圖的 GLB，接進 Three.js \n－附上 Fold 動畫，讓素材自己折出來\n－已有符合格式的紙模型圖樣，也能跳過 AI 上色 作者示範用 12 種資產，在場景裡擺放 75 次，再讓物件沿著道路依序折起來，組成一座萬聖節村莊。 \n目前以簡單形狀為主，需要 Blender 4.x；AI 上色需付費 API。 1.3 美元是作者的示範成本，場景編排工具則不包含在 repo。","timestamp":"2026-11-13T05:59:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfq79C-k4JH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfq79C-k4JH","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"github.com/lejri…","timestamp":"2026-11-13T05:59:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfqK64xk_1I","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfqK64xk_1I","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🎮 線上試玩：\nmalilion.github.io/shuan…\n🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/malil…","timestamp":"2026-11-12T22:51:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfqKwypAGXU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfqKwypAGXU","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"用Fable5.2 3D 武俠遊戲《霜月問劍》\n\n3 大關卡：月夜山門、寒潭劍塚、雲巔天闕 \n三段斬擊、格擋彈反、閃避與劍氣技能 \n御劍飛行、飛劍追敵、劍陣環身 \n召喚白虎靈獸協助戰鬥 \n華麗大招「千刃歸月」，法陣、劍雨與滿月斬 \n每關都有兩階段 Boss，還會施放專屬大招\n\n如果你也喜歡仙俠、御劍飛行或動作遊戲，歡迎來挑戰看看！\n\n#ThreeJS #GameDev #AI #VibeCoding #IndieGame","timestamp":"2026-11-12T22:51:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfo9dQHk3qq","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfo9dQHk3qq","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"太誇張了吧！現在 AI 已經可以直接做出 3D 動作遊戲了！\n\n有人用 Fable 5.2，只花一個下午，就打造出一款可以直接在瀏覽器玩的 3D 動作遊戲！\n\n更扯的是：\n🎮 3D 模型、場景設計全部交給 AI\n⚔️ 戰鬥動作、打擊手感也能處理\n🚀 包含遊戲效能與體積最佳化\n📦 最後竟然濃縮成一個約 30MB 的 HTML 檔案！\n\n而且作者還開源了 guizang-game-skill，把 AI 製作遊戲的流程、反覆測試與最佳化經驗整理成 Skill。\n\n雖然不是一次生成，而是經過多輪調整，但這真的讓人開始期待：\n\n未來做遊戲，會不會只需要一個想法和 AI？\n\n#AI #Fable52 #GameDev #OpenSource","timestamp":"2026-11-12T11:35:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfo9g8IE8Cn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfo9g8IE8Cn","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🎮 線上試玩：\nop7418.github.io/guiza…\n\n⭐ GitHub 開源：\ngithub.com/op741…","timestamp":"2026-11-12T11:35:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DfuXypeAWw3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfuXypeAWw3","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原來司機會有這種困擾？！😲\n一位卡友發現最近看到有人在討論\n下公車要不要跟司機說謝謝\n因為有網友在公車上看到一個公告\n寫著「下車時請不用說謝謝」\n不用兩字還特別加粗\n\n有司機就出來說\n是因為怕沒說不客氣被客訴\n而且每個人都說謝謝的話要一直回很累\n\n大家會習慣說謝謝嗎？🧐","timestamp":"2026-11-14T14:00:52.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":6,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfuQ13biQsP","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfuQ13biQsP","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"快來分享你們的娃包😍\n一位卡友發現 現在出門人手一個娃包\n我也來分享我的烏薩奇寶寶～\n\n想看看大家的娃包😆呀哈！","timestamp":"2026-11-14T13:00:09.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":9,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":23,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfuQ3PMCZ-z","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfuQ3PMCZ-z","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B2卡友：最近剛幫吉伊寶寶買了新的包包🥰","timestamp":"2026-11-14T13:00:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfuQ4h_icH3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfuQ4h_icH3","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B10卡友：根本不夠放","timestamp":"2026-11-14T13:00:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfuQ6C0iTE8","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfuQ6C0iTE8","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B6卡友：直接買內建透明袋的包🥰","timestamp":"2026-11-14T13:00:43.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfuKBQSDOzb","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfuKBQSDOzb","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家有看過經痛等級表嗎\n一位卡友分享\n自己大概常常疼痛第四到第五級之間徘徊\n就算吃止痛藥\n半夜也會被痛醒，怎麼躺都不舒服\n\n你是第幾級呢🥲","timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:00:32.000Z","stats":{"likes":140,"replies":8,"reposts":5,"shares":236},"score":171,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfuKCevjKdR","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfuKCevjKdR","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"歡迎分享緩解經痛的方法🥹🥲\n原文來自✨大家真的不要忽視經痛帶來的影響✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多女孩的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:00:42.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfrzAusEqaV","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfrzAusEqaV","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"以下開放雙子座回答🙌\n原文來自✨雙子座❤✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多星座的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-13T14:01:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfry_pTkj-A","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfry_pTkj-A","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"以下卡友分析雙子座的特質你被說中幾點？👀\n\n1.很念舊，很容易想回到以前\n2.很會安慰人但自己受傷永遠悶在心裡不說\n3.喜歡一個人非常被動，永遠等對方主動(這很不好😭\n4.腦袋裝很多很奇怪鬼點子\n5.很!專!情!!!!!! (你們同意嗎!!!!\n6.延伸第五點，被我們喜歡的人可以很幸福\n7.面對心裡在意的事情，往往會隱藏起來裝作不在乎\n或是用沉默表達自己的不滿\n8.需要有個人能聽到內心的聲音，並告訴我們該怎麼做\n\n歡迎留言分享更多雙子座特質！","timestamp":"2026-11-13T14:00:51.000Z","stats":{"likes":381,"replies":11,"reposts":38,"shares":89},"score":517,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfru80xGAd8","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfru80xGAd8","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"如果是你會繼續待在這間公司嗎😲\n原文來自✨#閒聊 才進公司一個月已經發現一堆怪事，我是不是應該快逃？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多工作的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-13T13:25:31.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfrsFm6k3b5","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfrsFm6k3b5","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"身邊的人支持誰，會影響你的選擇嗎？🧐\n年輕人都在這裡等你破圈\n馬上到 Dcard 為你支持的候選人發聲👉  dcard.link/zbgDq…","timestamp":"2026-11-13T13:00:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfrsEN8E5pi","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfrsEN8E5pi","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"發現自己容易被帶風向，怎麼辦？🧐\n有位卡友在六都市長大選看板分享\n常常覺得自己容易受別人影響，面對選舉時也不太確定該怎麼做決定\n如果發現自己的想法容易跟著別人改變，你會怎麼找回自己的判斷呢？🤔","timestamp":"2026-11-13T13:00:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfrlSDBDS-z","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfrlSDBDS-z","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"4. 公司很喜歡開會 但主管不喜歡大家把會議上說的事情記得太清楚\n\n5. 同事一直提醒我不要在茶水間聊天\n\n6. 部門裡有一位同事 大家都會私下提醒新人不要跟他走太近\n但沒有人願意說原因\n\n7. 公司同事大部分工作時間都會自己戴上耳機 與外界雜音隔離\n主管很喜歡經過你後面\n叫你把耳機拿下來或是突然把你耳機拿下來 確認你在聽什麼\n說為了避免有人上班偷追劇\n\n8. 公司很愛說大家是一個團隊\n但只要有人請假\n隔天就會有人開始問他是不是最近比較常有事情是不是比較多\n聽說是主管想透過口風去了解請假的同事是不是偷偷去面試\n有時候連請假原因都會被拿來討論","timestamp":"2026-11-13T12:01:02.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfrlRCkDUYc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfrlRCkDUYc","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"請大家幫忙看看卡友該怎麼做🥹\n一位卡友分享才進公司一個月已經發現一堆怪事：\n\n1. 公司有幾個空位明明沒人坐 卻完全不能碰\n後來才知道那是以前主管的位置 人都離職半年了 位置還留著\n連桌上的東西都沒人敢動\n\n2. 大家明明沒有規定要加班 也沒有什麼事需要加班\n但只要部門主管還沒走 幾乎沒有人敢先下班\n\n3. 新人好像有某種午餐潛規則\n大家都固定跟幾個資深同事一起訂 然後就會擠在會議室一起吃\n我第一次不知道 自己出去買午餐\n回來還被問怎麼沒有跟大家一起訂 是不是不想跟不熟的人吃飯？","timestamp":"2026-11-13T12:00:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":10,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T02:13:51+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"DfuOUHDlEFF","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfuOUHDlEFF","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Windows 11 還藏著一堆老式對話框，裝置管理員也像穿越時空。微軟設計主管回應，Win32 對話框與 MMC 工具的現代化正在處理，但尚未公布完整時程。為何換介面沒想像中簡單？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:38:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfuOUewlCKA","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfuOUewlCKA","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-14T12:38:06.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfuEMz_CgFX","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfuEMz_CgFX","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"神人網友受不了每次都要自己去刷有沒有更新，乾脆自己做了一個追番網站「YOKAR 優可線上看」：新集數會自動整合，訂閱的作品一更新，瀏覽器就跳通知。","timestamp":"2026-11-14T11:10:46.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":4},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dft5kwmlB8D","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Dft5kwmlB8D","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"追動畫不用每次回 YouTube 翻集數！台灣網友做的 YOKAR 把動畫、電影與戲劇整理成串流網站介面，提供分類搜尋與訂閱更新。實際怎麼找片、追連載？可播放範圍仍依各頻道為準。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-14T09:36:50.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-11-14T23:32:39+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dft5lNPlE8z","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Dft5lNPlE8z","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","